# Kilo Code local state inside .kilo/ (never versioned):
# - agent-manager.json  — Agent Manager UI/worktree/session state
# - worktrees/          — managed git worktrees
# - plans/              — session plan documents (local scratch, like .agent_scratchpad.md)
# - tmp/                — session scratch
# - __pycache__/        — python bytecode from .kilo/scripts/
agent-manager.json
worktrees/
plans/
tmp/
__pycache__/
*_out.txt

# Repo-root local state
/MEMORY.md
.agent_scratchpad.md
# Cycle metrics are session-local state, not repo artifacts
_metrics/
